Two tests in the same file pass individually and fail against each other when the suite runs normally. The second one asserts on a counter the first one increments, and the value it sees is inconsistent between runs — sometimes 0, sometimes 1.

let counter = 0;
test('a', async () => { counter++; /* ... */ });
test('b', async () => { expect(counter).toBe(0); /* flaky */ });

